@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:product] saved-frame-tailwind-coverage
The Tailwind build MUST request the frozen V3 utility vocabulary, including utilities absent from
local components. Saved Frames are loaded at runtime and cannot be scanned during the build.
Classes no longer emitted by V4 MUST be recorded in the build's coverage report. The migration uses
V4 rendering behavior and does not promise V3 visual equivalence.

@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:product] frame-authored-color-scheme
Default semantic colors MUST follow the consuming element's color scheme. A Frame subtree with
`color-scheme: light` MUST retain the light palette inside a dark host, and an explicit dark subtree
MUST retain the dark palette inside a light host. Authored theme variable overrides MUST take precedence.

@cc [owner:flvndvd,label:product] frame-document-content-theme
Document prose MUST inherit Frame font and semantic color variables. Code MUST use the Frame's
monospace font, and links MUST use its primary color. Content theme overrides MUST NOT restyle
editor controls, tooltips, or named Frame visual subtrees. Body text and headings use the sans font
unless the authored content explicitly selects another font.
